Output ../assets/demo/media.gif
Output ../assets/demo/media.mp4
Source tapes/settings.tape
Set Height 960

Hide
Type "clear && beepertui" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "J"
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 800ms
# one search across every source
Type ":media cat"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Down@400ms 3
Sleep 1.5s
# memes: search by meaning, caption with a live preview
Tab
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+U
Type "panic fire"
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "the build at 5pm / this is fine"
Sleep 4s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
# reactions: real animated GIFs, no key needed
Ctrl+G
Sleep 800ms
Tab
Sleep 300ms
Ctrl+U
Type "wave"
Sleep 5s
Down
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
